---
description: Assign missing tender contributions to accountable teams with acceptable proof and deadline.
args:{goal:GoalContract;policy:PolicySelection;capabilities:CapabilityMatch[];evidence:EvidencePage[]}
returns:ContributionTask[]
---
For each capability gap request the smallest technical, financial or delivery fact that would resolve it. Name responsible owner, requirement IDs, evidence format and deadline. Escalate a mandatory gap without owner to bid/no-bid; do not invent a future promise.
